# Clean-room minimal test slice for ESKA #79.
# This is not an authoritative copy of the historical Protégé Travel ontology.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix travel: <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/travel.owl#> .

<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/travel.owl> a owl:Ontology .

travel:Activity a owl:Class .
travel:Destination a owl:Class .
